  "title": "Qt: ExportObjectDialog does not need to be Application Modal",
  "description": "The other statistics taps dialogs are not application modal either.\nMaking it be application modal makes it difficult to impossible to\nuse the dialog to examine frames where objects are exported in the\nmain window after the tapping is done and the dialog is filled out.\n\nThe same issue with the main window being frozen while tapping is\ngoing on, and with new statistics dialogs being blocked from nested\nretapping occurs as with other statistics dialogs.\n\nPing #20840",
